1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,060
Sorry I'm late.

2
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,920
You look really beautiful today.

3
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:20,640
Really?

4
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:23,000
I was worried I'd embarrass you.

5
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,600
No. Let's go.

6
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,430
I'll take you to meet my father.

7
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,740
Not at all.

8
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,200
Father.

9
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,060
This is Gu Xingcan.

10
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,860
Hello, Uncle.

11
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:42,800
Hello, Miss Gu.

12
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,520
What a perfect match.

13
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:48,460
Thank you, Uncle Zhao.

14
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:51,740
Xiao Ze, your recent business is doing well.

15
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,840
The new live stream is great.

16
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,000
Keep it up.

17
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,880
I will, Uncle Zhao.

18
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:58,740
I'll go over there first.

19
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:12,840
Congratulations to Xiaoya for winning the most votes today.

20
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:17,000
Thank you all.

21
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,360
Congratulations.

22
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,220
That's all thanks to you, sister.

23
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:30,640
What do you do for a living, Miss Gu?

24
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:33,170
I am the legal counsel for Mr. Ling's company.

25
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,009
That's a good position.

26
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,860
You should help Mr. Ling more at work in the future.

27
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:41,100
You flatter me, Uncle.

28
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:43,060
I will do my best to assist Mr. Ling.

29
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:45,440
Xingcan,

30
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,060
look around by yourself first.

31
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:50,600
I have some things to discuss with my father alone.

32
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:51,479
Okay.

33
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,100
Get this done right.

34
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,600
No mistakes allowed.

35
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:17,540
Rest assured, Father.

36
00:02:17,540 --> 00:02:19,200
I'll arrange it immediately.

37
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,280
You scared me.

38
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,800
Why do you always pop up out of nowhere?

39
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,730
Did you find anything suspicious?

40
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,580
No.

41
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:07,740
But what Yingying said is probably true.

42
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:08,860
Ling Hengsheng

43
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:11,460
must be the real mastermind behind the scenes.

44
00:03:11,940 --> 00:03:12,800
And that person

45
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:14,100
is very dangerous.

46
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:15,680
We need to be careful.

47
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,860
It's fine. With me here, he can't do anything to you.

48
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:26,780
Eating like this,

49
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:28,620
can your stomach take it?

50
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:33,079
There's one more. Do you want it?

51
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,010
Let's go.

52
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:43,860
Where are they?

53
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:46,180
I don't know.

54
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:48,980
It's your fault for distracting me.

55
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:50,180
Otherwise, would I have lost them?

56
00:03:50,180 --> 00:03:51,340
You're blaming me?

57
00:03:51,579 --> 00:03:52,840
Hurry up and find them!

58
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,480
Where should I look?

59
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:00,720
Over there.

60
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,400
Over there.

61
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,980
Why are they here?

62
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:06,920
Xingcan.

63
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,010
Why are you here?

64
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:14,860
I was looking for you.

65
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,760
I only left for a little while,

66
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:20,040
and you're already worried about me?

67
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:21,980
You left me here all alone.

68
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,310
I don't know anyone,

69
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,680
so it's a bit awkward.

70
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:25,640
Sorry.

71
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,540
I was busy with something.

72
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:28,380
I'm done now.

73
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:29,340
Let's go back.

74
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:30,480
Okay.

75
00:04:37,940 --> 00:04:38,760
Let me do it.

76
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,000
Come.

77
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,840
Xingcan.

78
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:52,800
What do you think of my father?

79
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:55,840
Your father?

80
00:06:56,580 --> 00:06:57,780
He is very nice

81
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:58,940
and kind.

82
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,280
I'm glad

83
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:04,140
you said that.

84
00:07:15,340 --> 00:07:16,180
Mr. Ling.

85
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,600
Why did you choose me?

86
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:21,870
There are so many excellent girls around you.

87
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,880
Because you are special.

88
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,810
Unlike those girls who have clear motives

89
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,370
and are overly submissive,

90
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,640
you are completely different.

91
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:40,440
Mr. Ling, we are moving too fast.

92
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,500
Didn't you promise

93
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,700
to be my girlfriend?

94
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:47,780
What?

95
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:49,360
Regretting it?

96
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,140
No, no.

97
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,320
I just think a good relationship

98
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,980
needs time to adjust.

99
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:56,710
Aren't we adjusting right now?

100
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:58,700
Wait a minute.

101
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:01,180
Wait a minute.

102
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:05,180
Mr. Ling, how about we drink some more wine?

103
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,900
I... It's not a good time for me today.

104
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,340
Chenyao, come here quickly.

105
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,880
What took you so long?

106
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:27,680
Do you know if you were any later, I would...

107
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:29,780
I rushed over here, didn't I?

108
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:32,240
I came right after getting the evidence.

109
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,220
Are you okay?

110
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:34,960
Where is the evidence?

111
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,840
These two people,

112
00:08:44,380 --> 00:08:46,840
I've seen them at the art exhibition before.

113
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,380
These bastards.

114
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,840
Can we arrest them immediately now?

115
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:54,780
This evidence alone

116
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:57,400
is not enough to convict the Ling family.

117
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:01,640
Handling a case is so complicated for you guys nowadays.

118
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,560
In my time,

119
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,800
I would have wiped them out long ago.

120
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:05,960
In your time?

121
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:09,940
It's fine.

122
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:12,880
We can continue investigating here

123
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:15,010
and see if we can find any strong clues.

124
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:15,880
Makes sense.

125
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,730
Get some rest early.

126
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,410
Hold on a little longer.

127
00:10:12,640 --> 00:10:13,960
Everything will pass.

128
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,960
Did you search the cabinet below?

129
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,060
I searched it.

130
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:42,460
Over there.

131
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,540
Why are you acting like it's not your problem?

132
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:48,000
Come over and help me look.

133
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:50,280
I don't know what's useful.

134
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,460
So you have to search it yourself.

135
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,540
Come here and look.

136
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,240
Open it quickly.

137
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,120
Me?

138
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,220
Who else?

139
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,180
Hurry up. It'll be dawn soon.

140
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,140
I can't open it.

141
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,680
You have so many superpowers,

142
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,080
but you can't open a safe?

143
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,720
I'm not a locksmith.

144
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,680
You're so unreliable.

145
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:26,010
Dropping the ball at the critical moment.

146
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:27,800
Come on, I just saved you.

147
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,760
You have the nerve to bring that up?

148
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:33,290
If you had come a little later, I would have...

149
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,600
Anyway, you're unreliable.

150
00:11:35,740 --> 00:11:36,980
You're being unreasonable.

151
00:11:36,980 --> 00:11:38,140
Who's being unreasonable?

152
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:39,140
You're being unreasonable.

153
00:11:39,140 --> 00:11:40,000
Say that again.

154
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,680
You're unreasonable.
